Fail2ban:

Installation:

sudo apt install epel-release -y
Sudo yum install fail2ban fail2ban-systemd -y
sudo systemctl enable fail2ban
Sudo systemctl start fail2ban

After this go to /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
ls
cd jail.d
vim sshd.local

Give the following content in file:
[sshd]
enabled = true
port = ssh
bantime = 3600
findtime = 600
maxretry = 5

sudo systemctl restart fail2ban 
sudo fail2ban-client status
sudo fail2ban-client status sshd  
